## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates the ability to architect a multi-tenant data pipeline with configurable reliability guarantees, encompassing tenant isolation, fault tolerance, performance optimization, and comprehensive observability—all critical for enterprise-grade streaming solutions.

## Key Concepts

- **Tenant Partitioning**: Dedicated Kinesis streams per tenant with isolated processing contexts
- **Processing Guarantees**: Exactly-once semantics via DynamoDB deduplication vs. at-least-once with retry mechanisms
- **Backpressure Management**: Dynamic shard autoscaling and Lambda concurrency controls based on SLA requirements
- **Observability**: OpenTelemetry integration for end-to-end monitoring and performance metrics
- **Audit & Compliance**: S3 metadata tracking and Glue catalog for data lineage and governance
- **Cost Optimization**: Per-tenant resource allocation and usage-based cost attribution

## Code Example

